OL,3,GNEWSATwo police officers among seven
OL,4,Akilled in pursued car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people including two police
OL,7,Fofficers have been killed in a crash
OL,8,Ffollowing a pursuit with a "suspicious"
OL,9,Fcar driving the wrong way down a
OL,10,Fdual-carriageway.
OL,12,FThe collision involved a marked police
OL,13,Fvehicle and Volkswagen Passat on the
OL,14,FA66 in South Bank, near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Fin Teesside, at about 03:39 BST,
OL,16,FCleveland Police said.
OL,18,FThe armed response police car was
OL,19,Ftravelling the right way down the road
OL,20,Fbefore the crash, with the occupants of
OL,21,Fboth vehicles pronounced dead at the
OL,22,Fscene, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
