OL,3,GNEWSATwo police officers among seven
OL,4,Akilled in pursued car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officers have been named as PC
OL,7,FMatthew Blades and PC Tom Clough, with
OL,8,FChief Constable Victoria Fuller saying
OL,9,Fthey were "brave officers protecting
OL,10,Four communities".
